 as well as harmless <a href=\"#/wiki/Mushroom%20Sniffer\">Mushroom Sniffers</a>.\n</p><p>Mushroom Digger mission of <a href=\"#/quest/bigfoots-burden-quest\">Bigfoot's Burden Quest</a> takes place here.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures on all 3 Floors</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mushroom%20Sniffer\"><img alt=\"Mushroom Sniffer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mushroom_Sniffer_cb7c02.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Mushroom%20Sniffer\">Mushroom Sniffer</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\"><img alt=\"Wyvern\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyvern_a6f445.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyvern</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">515</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">795</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">144</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\"