%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yellow%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Yellow Piece of Cloth</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Rod\">Terra Rod</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Green Piece of Cloth</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Earth%20Elemental\"><img alt=\"Massive Earth Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Massive_Earth_Elemental_beeef5.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Earth%20Elemental\">Massive Earth Elemental</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,330</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">553+ (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">108+ <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">445 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-241× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Lump of Earth (common)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rusted%20Armor\">Rusted Armor</a> (semi-rare